              1.  Ownership
              2.  Describing, binding and running
    2.  The connection
         1.  sqlite
              1.  Ownership
              2.  Library
              3.  Connections
              4.  Queries
              5.  Statements
              6.  Databases
              7.  Schema
              8.  Transactions
              9.  Settings
              10. Maintenance
    3.  Swapping
2.  COST
    ----
    1.  Sizes and moves
*/

#ifndef DJINTERP_DB_SQLITE_SQLITE_FACE_HPP
